{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "39fa7574-13be-8816-b32b-2dbfb75ece3a",
  "created_at": "2025-12-15T11:39:56-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Canvassing",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nadia E. Haddad",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Walter Tavares",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:38:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Canvassing, this is Walter. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:38:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes. I would like to, um, change my party. On my voter registration. [pause] How do I do that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:38:30-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can walk you through it. You'd fill out a new voter registration form and mark the party you want to be switched to. You can pick one up here at City Hall, or I can tell you how to get it online."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:38:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Online, I don't, [pause] I don't do the computer. Can I come in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:38:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Come by the canvassing office during regular business hours and we'll give you the form. Any day this week is fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:38:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And what, um, what ID do I need to bring? To fill it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:39:02-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For the form itself, your Rhode Island driver's license or state ID number is what it asks for. If you don't have one, the last four digits of your Social Security number work. You don't have to bring anything else to register, but bringing your license is easiest."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:39:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. The license. I have that. [pause] Hold on, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:39:21-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:39:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] I'm sorry. I was putting wood in the stove."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:39:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's no trouble. I heard a clang."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:39:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the door, it clangs. [pause] Now where was I. The license. Yes. And then I just bring the form back to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:39:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can fill it out right here at the counter and hand it to us. We'll process the change, and you'll get a new confirmation card in the mail."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:39:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. That is all I needed. Thank you, Walter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:39:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon, and stay warm."
    }
  ],
